---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SectionHeading from '@/components/SectionHeading.astro';
import {SITE} from '@/site.config';
---
<BaseLayout title="About"><section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pt-16 pb-24 sm:pt-24"><SectionHeading eyebrow="About"/><h1 class="font-display text-ink max-w-xl text-3xl font-medium sm:text-4xl">Zhaoyuan Kang · 康钊源</h1><p class="text-ink-soft mt-6" data-zh="哈尔滨工业大学（深圳）本科生。研究与工程兴趣包括计算力学、数值模拟、计算机体系结构和操作系统。">Undergraduate at Harbin Institute of Technology, Shenzhen. My interests include computational mechanics, numerical simulation, computer architecture and operating systems.</p><p class="text-ink-soft mt-5" data-zh="我喜欢从物理问题出发，完成模型推导、代码实现、仿真与实验验证的完整过程。">I enjoy working through the full process from physical questions to mathematical models, code, simulations, and experimental validation.</p><div class="mt-10"><SectionHeading eyebrow="Contact"/><a class="text-signal font-mono text-sm" href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a></div></section></BaseLayout>
